Conclusion
The A Whittle Wandering site is a thoughtfully designed platform that
combines narrative storytelling with live trip data and AI‑powered
tools. Core navigation works correctly: users can move between the
home page, demo, live journey and dashboard with ease. However,
several areas need refinement: interactive buttons should provide
feedback, scrolling on the live journey page could be smoother, route
optimisation should handle errors gracefully and placeholder panels
need clearer messaging. Addressing these issues and improving
accessibility will enhance the user experience for both travellers and
followers.